          <article class="card reveal">
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="tag">Personal project</p>
              <h3>ScamFilter —<br>Fraud Detection</h3>
              <p class="card__note">Ethereum wallet risk scoring · Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism &amp; Base</p>
              <p class="card__text">
                A three-layer detection engine for Ethereum wallets, combining blacklist
                matching against ScamSniffer's scam database with a custom behavioural
                scoring system.
              </p>
              <ul class="card__points">
                <li>11-signal heuristic scoring that detects sweeper bots, Sybil attacks and Permit2 drain attacks.</li>
                <li>Chain-aware signal routing across Ethereum L1 and L2s (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base), with era-specific gas thresholds and ERC-4337 paymaster griefing detection.</li>
                <li>Automated wallet health classification and a 90-day behavioural recovery system across 100k+ on-chain transaction records.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="chips">
                <span>Python</span><span>Polars</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Ethereum</span><span>ERC-4337</span>
